    <string name="replay_ledger_note">This book belongs to this replay session only. It is never written to the paper-trading journal and it is discarded when replay ends. Five basis points a side, the same fee the backtest charges. Stops and targets are checked against the candles that follow: a long is stopped by the candle\'s low, not by its close.</string>
